## Lessons Learned

This project demonstrated how firewall rules, DNS configuration, and network segmentation directly impact Active Directory communication and domain authentication. The lab reinforced the importance of validating network connectivity before attempting domain authentication and highlighted how pfSense can be used to securely control communication between VLANs in an enterprise environment.
